flowchart TD
  Notice[Notice useful signal] --> Correlate[Check and correlate evidence]
  Correlate --> Decide{Choose next action}
  Decide --> Propose[Review a small proposal]
  Decide --> Task[Hand off authorized work]
  Decide --> Watch[Wait for stronger evidence]
  Propose --> Verify[Verify the producing workflow]
  Task --> Verify
  Watch --> Notice
  Verify --> Notice
  class Watch wait
  class Verify ok
